{"date":"2017-07-13","platform":"WEB","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/02/14/219769_70Dkq.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/02/14/219769_70Dkq.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/02/14/219769_70Dkq.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/02/14/219769_70Dkq.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/02/14/219769_70Dkq.jpg"},"summary":"いつか、消えてゆくから。\r\n\r\nある夜、大学生のソウタは、見知らぬ少女ユキに出会う。\r\nかつてソウタに助けてもらったというユキは、買い物の仕方からフォークの持ち方まで、まるで外の世界を何も知らないかのようだった。\r\nユキには奇妙な点がもう一つあった。それは、肌が触れることを極端に恐れているいうこと。そんな不思議な少女との奇妙な生活は、少しづつ変化を見せていく。\r\nユキを奪おうと迫る男たち。地球の命運を握る力がユキにはあり、世界のために犠牲になれという。\r\nユキに宿る力とは何か。なぜが人に触れることを拒むのか。\r\nついにユキは、隠してきた真実をソウタに打ち明ける。","name":"劇場版アニメ『夢が覚めるまで』予告編","name_cn":"直到梦醒之时","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":168,"total_count":101410},{"name":"2017","count":99,"total_count":71092},{"name":"loundraw","count":85,"total_count":1444},{"name":"原创","count":70,"total_count":612818},{"name":"WEB","count":59,"total_count":70850},{"name":"剧场版","count":29,"total_count":717485},{"name":"FLATSTUDIO","count":28,"total_count":751},{"name":"校园","count":26,"total_count":446242},{"name":"奇幻","count":25,"total_count":462030},{"name":"FLAT_STUDIO","count":13,"total_count":57},{"name":"日本","count":11,"total_count":288809},{"name":"2017年7月","count":10,"total_count":22252},{"name":"日本动画","count":6,"total_count":34747},{"name":"Webアニメ","count":5,"total_count":191},{"name":"恋爱","count":5,"total_count":555459},{"name":"2017年","count":4,"total_count":4354},{"name":"PV","count":3,"total_count":891},{"name":"2010s","count":2,"total_count":5581},{"name":"世界系","count":2,"total_count":818},{"name":"爱情","count":2,"total_count":13505},{"name":"动画短片","count":1,"total_count":2067},{"name":"Bump","count":1,"total_count":7},{"name":"MV・PV・CM","count":1,"total_count":326},{"name":"类型-短片","count":1,"total_count":112},{"name":"下野纮","count":1,"total_count":442},{"name":"CM","count":1,"total_count":1604},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_count":3